# select-x2 (H3): picking x (already checked) at rest after the click. The x label.s centre
# is (174.5, 187): cell [49,170,83,34]. The click flushes func=x1 to the URL
# at once; the switch draws on over 900 ms, so the shot waits 2 s.
size 1440 900
density 2
scheme dark
mode dark
theme arctic-ice
wait 2000
click 174.5 187
wait 2000
shot select-x2
